{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>He loves</b> — He mentioned יושר (uprightness) alongside דבר (word), for it is the correct one." "<b>and faithfulness</b> — alongside the deeds that He brings to light every hidden thing." "<b>and righteousness</b> — like צדק (justice), in order to balance everything, and this is משפט (judgment) from this, and His חסד (kindness) encompasses all; therefore: the חסד of HaShem fills the earth."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:29:18.284522686Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}